    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλῠᾱρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nonsense, foolery,</i> in word
			or deed, <i><span class="en">
				Timocr.
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				159
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				162a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιὰ καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					46d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπνὸς κα φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					581d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρωμάτων καὶ ἄλλης πολλῆς φ. θνητῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					211e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				66c
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. καὶ λῆρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: freq. in pl., <i>fooleries,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆοοι καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					304b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε ληρήματα</span> . . , 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε φλυαρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					486c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ σιτία καὶ ποτὰ καὶ ἰατροὺς
				καὶ φ.</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				490c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				519a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνηθα καὶ σέλινα καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
